{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>Threads昨日（21日）流傳一段閉路電視影片，長約2分鐘，顯示昨晚約11時，一名截口罩的男子手持一個背囊和一張矮凳，進入一間夾公仔店，見到夾公仔機頂擺放雜物，包括有一個大袋，於是取走，並將凳放入袋中，口罩男繼而望向機頂，不時東張西望，最終在機頂取走一個電鑽，然後施施然離開。</p><p>帖主上載相關影片和圖像，指出事發夾公仔店位於屯門，「咁多支Cam，你都敢偷野」，警告對方若不聯絡歸還，就會報警，同時慨嘆「佢偷我啲貨都冇咁嬲，佢偷咗我個電批」。</p><p>許多網民留言指「GTA 6玩唔夠」、「懷疑張凳都係偷返嚟」、「佢唔係博拉佢唔到，係博無人拉佢」。</p><figure><img alt=\"口罩男進入一間夾公仔店，見到夾公仔機頂有一個大袋，於是取走。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201018049432391680108476.jpeg/jUHGZNi5LftWF4P8WEG9TfTl5B9NK4F-vVz5a71c-Ws\"/><figcaption>口罩男進入一間夾公仔店，見到夾公仔機頂有一個大袋，於是取走。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"口罩男將凳放入袋中。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201018093518721024371568.jpeg/AwTw74mFBtEepMRAbP7oAWuP29s4ySM_rVdyja1Xco0\"/><figcaption>口罩男將凳放入袋中。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"口罩男繼而望向機頂，不時東張西望。（Threads@seememeonly07圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201018142860513280206438.jpeg/SuaU_aI9_zh9M56aAoedxb8TMo7P6H2QcanWe3Gp1ns\"/><figcaption>口罩男繼而望向機頂，不時東張西望。（Threads@seememeonly07圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"口罩男在機頂取走一個電鑽。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201018189228544000206894.jpeg/-ILy5Jhop34a-0fqE_NPsWBfDm_M-2pKnR0bTp0dG04\"/><figcaption>口罩男在機頂取走一個電鑽。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"口罩男施施然離開。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261122/1201018233570725888854197.jpeg/V0OsQbcKQhT8_g_tZD3BEiLefCByXGDWvimuFr4prhY\"/><figcaption>口罩男施施然離開。（Threads@seememeonly07影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T20:24:37.384690+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":486,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T19:58:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T08:17:30.079930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T20:18:03.709452+00:00","content_hash":"7e09ef4d800149b4a5727fb9644bc7af2c801ae49090750a0810efab89c0819c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}